TITLE Pure water pH 7, 150C, equilibrate with chrysotile and talc; report SI quartz
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.csv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SI_Quartz
    10 PUNCH SI("Quartz")
END
